OL,3,GNEWSAMan arrested after woman raped on
OL,4,Acity common
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has been arrested in connection
OL,7,Fwith an investigation into the rape of
OL,8,Fa woman by a stranger in Southampton.
OL,10,FThe attack happened on Southampton
OL,11,FCommon, near Cemetery Road, shortly
OL,12,Fafter 05:30 GMT on Saturday.
OL,14,FThe woman, in her 30s, is being
OL,15,Fsupported by specialist officers and
OL,16,Fpolice said they had deployed
OL,17,F"significant resources" to the
OL,18,Finvestigation.
OL,20,FThe 42-year-old was arrested on Sunday
OL,21,Fmorning on suspicion of rape and
OL,22,Fremains in police custody.
